get.description:
Get the tracking URL based on the parent_id (company or sub-company).

Query Parameters:
    parent_id: Company or sub-company name (from CompanyInfoQueryParams)

Returns:
    Tracking URL for the specified parent with is_default flag

Example Response (specific mapping):
    {
        "status_code": 200,
        "response_type": "success",
        "description": "Tracking URL retrieved successfully",
        "data": {
            "tracking_url": "https://sca-cvc-prod.covatic.io/mobile/api/v1.0",
            "is_default": false
        }
    }

Example Response (default/fallback):
    {
        "status_code": 200,
        "response_type": "success",
        "description": "Tracking URL retrieved successfully",
        "data": {
            "tracking_url": "https://mobile-cvc-fra-cvc-dev.covatic.io/mobile/api/v1.0",
            "is_default": true
        }
    }

post.description:
Creates multiple Cognito users in bulk with specific roles and associated companies.

Expects payload like:
{
    "emails": ["imran+bulk1@covatic.com", "imran+bulk2@covatic.com"],
    "roles": ["super_admin"],
    "associated_companies": [
        {
            "parent_id": "BBC",
            "parent_type": "company",
            "is_default": true,
            "permissions": ["insights", "advertising"]
        }
    ],
    "company": {
        "parent_id": "BBC",
        "parent_type": "company"
    }
}

put.description:
Update user's associated companies and roles.

Expects payload like:
{
    "user_cognito_id": "3314b812-d061-7062-b980-5acc06868d34",
    "associated_companies": [
        {
            "parent_id": "Covatic US",
            "parent_type": "company",
            "is_default": false,
            "permissions": ["insights", "advertising"]
        },
        {
            "parent_id": "Covatic",
            "parent_type": "company",
            "is_default": true,
            "permissions": ["insights", "advertising"]
        }
    ],
    "roles": ["admin"]
}
